cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use spatialscape, please cite it as below."
title: "spatialscape: a static, reactive browser for spatial transcriptomics and snRNA-seq"
abstract: "One Python package: a command-line tool that turns AnnData, SpatialData, SpatialExperiment or Seurat objects into bundles of static files, and the web viewer that streams them. Every section of a study on one canvas, from an overview of an atlas down to single transcripts, with no server."
type: software
authors:
